# Walkthrough: Evario Odyssey (Girl Character Update)

I have successfully updated the player character to a girl child character and integrated it into the Mario-style game mechanics.

## Character Updates
- **New Sprite**: Replaced the placeholder rectangle with a cute 2D pixel art girl character.
- **Directional Orientation**: The sprite now automatically flips to face the direction of movement (Left/Right).
- **Animation Support**: The character maintains the smooth jumping and movement physics.

