## How to Play
1. The game is live at `http://localhost:5173/`.
2. **Controls**:
   - `Arrow Keys` or `WASD`: Move and Jump.
   - `Space`: Jump.

## Technical Details
- **Engine**: Canvas API.
- **Physics**: Custom implemented in [src/main.js](file:///c:/projects/Antigravity/EvaGames/evario/src/main.js).
- **Styling**: [src/style.css](file:///c:/projects/Antigravity/EvaGames/evario/src/style.css) provides the glassmorphism and neon effects.
